        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. He! Halleluijah guang dailiang mei pu,",
            "Thuanmei rui kandi lik kandiu;",
            "Kandi khou guang dai liang mei pu nang rui,",
            "Mei guai lung ning khou lat ncham lou o.",
            "",
            "Zai pat datro tatmaan kanmei guai,",
            "Zipri mei guai ta nchiang thau o;",
            "Kandi zailou mei guang dailiang mei pu",
            "Ning sum mei le rian ra mei ram tigan no.",
            "",
            "2. Guang david le zailou mei messiah guang ,",
            "Kandi guang suang daimei nang e,",
            "Ntao khrista le bumang than mei rui,",
            "Amu dai liang mei ganchuang na nang nge,",
            "",
            "3. He! Guang dailiang mei le kanlou meipu,",
            "Suaihiem lou mei kallou meipu,",
            "Kandih dam thao khou dou luai mei lauziu,",
            "Kazei paan rui kandih hei kanlou the;",
            "",
            "4. Dui lev kandih damthao mak khou ruina ,",
            "Thai nagm bam mei Ravguangc nang e,",
            "Neih lev bw lev gaanchuanga guay tei ni,",
            "Nang paan khou ruina gaan bam pui tuang e."
          ]
        }
      }
